// Boss encounter spec — GNU2, the giant's armored sequel (GNUTON-GNU2-FINALE).
//
// It waits in a containment cell under GNU-ton's arena, asleep: it wakes
// after GNU-ton (`wakes_after`), and GNU-ton calls his successors at his
// enrage (`successors_wake: Enraged` in `gnu_ton_rider.ron`), through a pair
// of portals from the cell's floor to the air over the hall. It fights in
// one phase: it walks the hall, stomps, and bucks a body off its back. See
// the `gnu2` row in `boss_profiles.ron`.
//
// It escorts GNU-ton (`escort`): no hit lands on it and it shows no health
// bar, and it falls when he is cleared. The fight is the rider; the giants
// are the stage he fights on (Jon, 2026-11-21: "we should probably make both
// of the gnu invulnerable").
(
    id: "gnu2",
    name: "GNU2",
    max_hp: 30,
    // One phase: it never reaches a transition or an enrage.
    phase1_to_transition_hp: 0.0,
    phase2_to_enrage_hp: 0.0,
    // It falls through the pair as it wakes; its intro is its landing.
    intro_seconds: 1.4,
    transition_seconds: 0.0,
    music_intro: "",
    music_phase1: "",
    music_phase2: "",
    music_enrage: "",
    escort: true,
)
